      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Good instinct to predict first — let's commit to an answer before I explain anything.\n\n```openui lifecycle=ephemeral id=tile-draw-prediction\n\nroot = LearningSurface([guess], \"Before the explanation\", \"Make a prediction, then I'll show why.\", \"ephemeral\")\nguess = Question([{ header: \"Your prediction\", question: \"The bag holds 4 tiles: 1 square and 3 round. You reach in and draw one tile at random. Which shape are you most likely to draw?\", type: \"choice\", choices: [\"Square\", \"Round\", \"Both are equally likely\", \"There isn't enough information to say\"], allowText: true, hint: \"Think about how many of each shape are in the bag, not about the order they went in.\" }], \"ephemeral\", \"Probability of a random draw\", \"Pick the shape you think is most likely — or write your own reasoning.\")\n\n```"
        }
      ]
    }
